#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Into the water with it, let it sprout... In a week, the best ale of the lakes!"
msgstr "Suya koy, filizlensin... Bir hafta sonra göllerin en iyi birası hazır!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale was brewed from barley and water, often with herbs instead of hops."
msgstr "Bira arpa ve sudan yapılırdı; şerbetçiotu yerine çoğu zaman başka otlar katılırdı."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
