#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ten crates of Dagny's pots, and not one broken! The best rowing of the lakes."
msgstr ""
"Dagny'nin çömleklerinden on sandık, bir tanesi bile kırılmadan! Göllerin en iyi kürekçiliği."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
